  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "残念だが……『W.I.N.G.』には出場できなかった\r\nせっかくここまで来れたのにな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001080010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ちょ、プロデューサー\r\nそげん落ち込まんとってよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400108/7004001080010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001080020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサーば先に落ち込まれたら\r\nうちが落ち込めんばいー",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400108/7004001080020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまない……\r\n俺よりも恋鐘の方が悔しいはずだもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001080030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "だから謝らんとってよ！\r\nそれにさっきのは冗談やけん。うち、落ち込む気はないよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400108/7004001080030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001080040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "確かに、選考落ちたんは残念やし悔しいよ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400108/7004001080040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001080050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "けど、これで落ち込むんはうちらしくないけん！\r\nファンのみんなもそんなうち見たくないばい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400108/7004001080050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな\r\n恋鐘の言う通りだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001080060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やけん、うちは落ち込まんよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
